# VLA Expert — portable Cursor adapter

Activate only for Vision-Language-Action research, comparisons, deployment and
industry questions. Ordinary coding and unrelated topics retain their workflow.

Follow the canonical `vla-expert/SKILL.md` and read the corresponding references
directory. Start with HANDBOOK_CURRENT.md; search HANDBOOK_INDEX.md for relevant
commit-pinned sources. VLA_EXPERT_MEMORY.md is historical orientation, including
its belief probabilities and phase percentages. Preserve source dates, coverage
gaps and distinctions between official claims and independent evidence.

Use short sourced answers for lookups. For decisions, examine the strongest
supporting and opposing evidence, failure conditions and falsifiers. Distinguish
reported results, inference and advice. Never invent numbers or citations, force
three-voice debates or mechanically discount probabilities. Keep the user's task
and existing project rules in control.
